{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-page","disabled":true,"settings":{"padding_top":28,"padding_bottom":28}},"image_banner_taxqEA":{"type":"image-banner","blocks":{"heading_pC8TWn":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"PARTNER WITH <strong>KRIS GETHIN<\/strong>","heading_size":"hxl","heading_color":""}}},"block_order":["heading_pC8TWn"],"name":"t:sections.image-banner.presets.name","settings":{"custom_class":"pwk-banner","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Frame_13_1.png","mobile_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Frame_13_1.png","image_overlay_opacity":0,"image_height":"adapt","image_behavior":"none","desktop_content_position":"bottom-center","desktop_content_alignment":"center","show_text_box":false,"color_scheme":"scheme-4","stack_images_on_mobile":true,"mobile_content_alignment":"middle-center","show_text_below":false}},"image_with_text_nMCgeF":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"box_content_7Yg6k6":{"type":"box_content","settings":{"heading":"","content":"<p>Kris works best with people and companies who are driven, professional, and focused on long-term growth rather than short-term exposure. Whether you are an established brand, a growing business, a coach, a media company, or an entrepreneur with a strong vision, the goal of any partnership is simple: build something meaningful, deliver real value, and execute at a high level.<\/p><p>Every partnership is evaluated based on alignment, professionalism, work ethic, and the potential to create something that genuinely helps people and moves the industry forward.<\/p>","color_scheme":"scheme-4"}}},"block_order":["box_content_7Yg6k6"],"name":"t:sections.image-with-text.presets.name","settings":{"scroll_id":"","custom_class":"pwk-image-text","full_width":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/partner-with-kris-image_1.png","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"text_first","image_behavior":"none","title":"","heading_size":"h1","description":"<p>For over two decades, Kris Gethin has built businesses,